{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "apc-mini",
  "name": "AKAI APC mini",
  "notes": "APC mini (first generation). Pad grid note layout: note 0 = bottom-left pad, note 63 = top-right (note = (8 - row) * 8 + column - 1, row 1 at the top). Pad LEDs are single tri-colour LEDs picked by feedback velocity: 0 off, 1 green, 2 green blinking, 3 red, 4 red blinking, 5 yellow, 6 yellow blinking. The round track buttons (notes 64-71, red) and scene buttons (notes 82-89, green) are single-colour: velocity 0 off, 1 on, 2 blinking. The shift button (note 98) has no LED. Faders (CC 48-56) are not motorized and have no LED, so fader feedback is not possible on this board.",
  "manufacturer": "AKAI Professional",
  "mode": "standard",
  "defaultMidiChannel": 1,
  "layout": {
    "width": 9,
    "height": 12
  },
